Here we go!

493
00:23:20,632 --> 00:23:23,732
えー、徐々、徐々にやっていくよりも...
Huh, instead of doing it gradually, bit by bit...

494
00:23:24,032 --> 00:23:25,332
おらおらおらー！
Take that, take that!

495
00:23:25,032 --> 00:23:28,032
知力担当がいいの、それして？確率的に...
Is it okay for the "brains of the group" to do that? Statistically...

496
00:23:28,832 --> 00:23:32,032
売られた喧嘩は... 買う！
When someone picks a fight... I'll take it!

