1549
01:07:40,104 --> 01:07:42,104
4単…w
Single wait on 4...

1550
01:07:42,104 --> 01:07:44,604
来い！単騎来い！
Come on! Hit that single wait!

1551
01:07:44,604 --> 01:07:45,604
2！
2!

1552
